  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "でんきの　かたまりを　あいてに\nぶつける。あいてより　すばやさが\nはやいほど　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "전기 덩어리를 상대에게 부딪쳐서\n공격한다. 상대보다 스피드가\n빠를수록 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用電球攻擊對手。\n速度比對手快越多，\n威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur envoie une boule d’électricité.\nSi sa Vitesse est plus grande que celle de l’ennemi,\nles dégâts augmentent d’autant.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Je höher die Initiative des Anwenders im Vergleich\nzum Ziel ist, desto stärker trifft dieses eine geballte\nLadung Strom.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una bola eléctrica. Cuanto mayor sea la\nVelocidad del usuario en comparación con la del\nobjetivo, mayor será el daño causado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa attacca con una sfera d’energia elettrica.\nPiù è rapido rispetto al bersaglio, più danni arreca.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user hurls an electric orb at the target. The\nfaster the user is than the target, the greater the\nmove’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "電気の　塊を　相手に\nぶつける。相手より　素早さが\n速いほど　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用电气团撞向对手。\n自己比对手速度越快，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lanza una bola eléctrica. Cuanto mayor sea la\nVelocidad del usuario en comparación con la del\nobjetivo, mayor será el daño causado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
